name=Gasoline Degradation
id=GasolineDegradation
description=Gasoline slowly degrades over time in vehicles, gas pumps and any container that holds it. Stockpile early, because it won't last forever. (Gas/Gasoline goes bad) IMPORTANT: if you add this mod to a save that is already in progress, set "Start day" to the day the save is on right now. Otherwise the degradation is counted from day 0 of the world and is applied to all the gasoline when you return.
